# Gaps report and a sectional turntable from a parameter file
# (Development Issues #88). The turntable is a TURNOUT with 8 positions on a
# circle, all pointing out from its centre; stall tracks join it east and
# west. Its 6 unused positions are open by design, as a TURNTABLE's are, so
# the saved report counts them as turntable stalls, not open ends. The
# isolated open ends are the stall tracks' far ends and the plain straight's
# two ends: 4. Compared with gapsturntable-expected/report-gaps.txt.
